                                "sense_id": "656cd6c3-9fb0-3146-80f1-16e9be63a8e0",
                                "text": "Na de vierde afstraffing keerden zelfs hun fans zich tegen de ploeg.",
                                "translation": "After the fourth mortal loss even their fans turned on the team.",
